andidate C.\n\nWe need to reference discussion (none). We can say \"Given the current evidence, I propose Candidate C\". Provide evidence: reliability 100%, correct decisions quickly, positive atmosphere. Mention concerns: communication difficulty, egocentric, not willing to further education, but weigh against strengths.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote Candidate C."}
